68
00:06:43,560 --> 00:06:48,080
But Jesus saw that the disciples had restrained children from coming to him.

69
00:06:48,080 --> 00:06:56,920
And he said, the Bible says he was greatly displeased and said, let the children come to me and do not forbid them, for such is the kingdom of God.

70
00:06:56,920 --> 00:07:06,580
And I know a lot of people will say, well, what if he meant that in a figurative sense, that it takes humility, all right, to approach God in heaven.

71
00:07:06,660 --> 00:07:18,260
But when you look at Matthew, chapter 18 from verse three to six, the way he doubled down on the idea, it now seems more than just like a metaphorical idea.

72
